<title>GERMANY: Karstadt - decline in 96 group net profits.</title>
<headline>Karstadt - decline in 96 group net profits.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN, Germany 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   58.6    vs 109</p>
<p>    Parent net profit			  114     vs 189.2</p>
<p>    Dividend				     10	vs 13 marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German retail group is Karstadt AG.</p>
